---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Classic Porsche: 924 to 991"
description: "Known issues, repair costs, guides, torque specs, and buyer's guides for the Porsche 924, 928, 944, 964, 993, 996, 997, 991, 986 Boxster, and 987 Boxster/Cayman."
breadcrumbs:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Porsche" }
---
{% set b = stats.byBrand.porsche %}
<section class="brand-hero">
    <div class="brand-hero-content">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Porsche</p>
        <h1>Ten Porsches: front-engined, air-cooled, and water-cooled.</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">From the Audi-engined 924 to the 991. The failures each one is known for, how to fix them, and what it'll cost.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-bar" aria-label="Porsche coverage">
    <dl class="stats-container">
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Cars</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.vehicles }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Known issues</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.issues }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Guides</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.guides }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Torque specs</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.torqueSpecs }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section id="vehicles" class="vehicles-section">
    <div class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h2 class="brand-title">Front-engine transaxle</h2>
            <p class="brand-blurb">924, 944, and 928: engine up front, gearbox at the back.</p>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = "porsche" %}{% set gridKeys = ["924", "944", "928"] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h2 class="brand-title">Air-cooled 911</h2>
            <p class="brand-blurb">The 964 and 993, the last of the air-cooled cars.</p>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = "porsche" %}{% set gridKeys = ["964", "993"] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h2 class="brand-title">Water-cooled 911</h2>
            <p class="brand-blurb">996, 997, and 991.</p>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = "porsche" %}{% set gridKeys = ["996", "997", "991"] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h2 class="brand-title">Boxster & Cayman</h2>
            <p class="brand-blurb">The mid-engined cars: 986 and 987.</p>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = "porsche" %}{% set gridKeys = ["986", "987"] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </div>
    {% set gridKeys = null %}
</section>

<section class="quick-search-section">
    <div class="quick-search-container">
        <h2>What are you working on?</h2>
        <p>Search every Porsche page for issues, guides, specs, and parts.</p>
        <form class="home-search-form" action="/search/" method="get" role="search">
            <input type="hidden" name="brand" value="Porsche">
            <label for="brand-search" class="visually-hidden">Search Porsche pages</label>
            <input type="search" id="brand-search" name="q" placeholder="IMS bearing, RMS leak, timing belt…" class="home-search-input">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Search</button>
        </form>
        <p class="popular-searches">
            <span>People look up:</span>
            <a href="/search/?q=ims+bearing&amp;brand=Porsche">IMS bearing</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=timing+belt&amp;brand=Porsche">Timing belt</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=rms+leak&amp;brand=Porsche">RMS leak</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=coolant+pipe&amp;brand=Porsche">Coolant pipes</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=air+oil+separator&amp;brand=Porsche">AOS</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
